 "title": "Why Does Ukraine's Space Internet Have a Speed Limit?",
 "voice": "am_michael",
 "speed": 1.0,
 "description": "This week Ukraine said its Starlink and Starshield satellite terminals started dropping out when moving faster than about 160 km/h (100 mph), which hit the interceptor drones it uses against fast Russian attack drones. Who ordered it? SpaceX's founder says Starshield limits are decided by the U.S. military and ultimately the president; Reuters and the Telegraph reported the order came from the White House; the President and the Secretary of State deny it. Plus: why Europe's Eutelsat jumped 23%, and what to watch next. Explained with stick figures, facts only.\n\nDave and Linda are made-up characters. Real people are shown as generic labelled stick figures; quotes are attributed as reported.\n\nSources:\nAxios, Zelensky says Musk-owned satellite system still restricted in Ukraine (Oct 17, 2026): https://www.axios.com/2026/10/17/zelensky-starlink-elon-musk-trump\nAxios, Trump: White House didn't impede satellite system in Ukraine (Oct 16, 2026): https://www.axios.com/2026/10/16/trump-starlink-musk-ukraine-zelensky\nReuters, Order to limit Starshield for Ukraine came from inside White House, sources say (Oct 15, 2026): https://www.reuters.com/world/europe/order-limit-starshield-ukraine-came-inside-white-house-sources-say-2026-10-15\nReuters via Euronext, Eutelsat shares jump as Ukraine flags curbs on Starlink military-grade service (Oct 14, 2026): https://live.euronext.com/en/financial-news/eutelsat-shares-jump-ukraine-flags-curbs-starlink-military-grade-service\nCNBC, Trump denies Musk claim he ordered Starlink restrictions in Ukraine (Oct 16, 2026): https://www.cnbc.com/2026/10/16/trump-denies-musk-claim-he-ordered-starlink-restrictions-in-ukraine.html\nMediaite (citing The Telegraph), Musk pitched cuts to Ukraine's Starshield to Trump (Oct 16, 2026): https://www.mediaite.com/media/news/musk-pitched-cuts-to-ukraines-starshield-direct-to-trump-who-then-agreed-report/\nRBC-Ukraine, Zelenskyy calls Starlink restrictions a planned operation (Oct 17, 2026): https://newsukraine.rbc.ua/news/zelenskyy-calls-starlink-restrictions-in-1792243118.html\nBabel, Rubio says White House did not order restrictions (Oct 18, 2026): https://babel.ua/en/news/131058-the-us-secretary-of-state-says-white-house-did-not-order-restrictions-on-starlink-operations-in-ukraine-and-ukraine-never-had-access-to-starshield\nDW, Why Starlink matters in Ukrainian warfare (Oct 18, 2026): https://www.dw.com/en/why-starlink-is-so-important-for-ukraine/a-79689729\nRBC-Ukraine (citing the Financial Times), US fears Starlink restrictions in Europe (Oct 18, 2026): https://newsukraine.rbc.ua/news/us-fears-starlink-restrictions-in-europe-1792352863.html\n\n#starlink #ukraine #spacex #starshield #explained #stickfigure #news",
